  "body": "Welcome to 32 Kumukumu Road — a beautifully designed home that perfectly combines modern comfort, generous space, and breathtaking sea views.\r\n\r\nThis impressive residence offers 4 spacious bedrooms plus a study, ideal for growing families or those working from home. With two separate living areas — one upstairs and one downstairs — there is plenty of room for relaxation and entertaining.\r\n\r\nThe home features 3.5 well-appointed bathrooms, including two ensuites (one on each level), providing convenience and privacy for family members and guests alike. The upstairs master suite is a true retreat, complete with a private balcony showcasing fantastic sea views.\r\n\r\nDownstairs, the open-plan kitchen, dining, and living area flows seamlessly out to a sun-soaked deck and garden — perfect for entertaining or unwinding while enjoying the coastal outlook. The stylish kitchen is equipped with a large island benchtop and ample storage, making it both functional and elegant.\r\n\r\nAdditional highlights include:\r\n• Separate laundry\r\n• Double internal-access garage\r\n• Two additional off-street parking spaces\r\n• Stunning sea views from the kitchen, living area, and deck\r\n• 10-Year Master Builder Guarantee\r\n\r\nThis is a rare opportunity to secure a quality home in a desirable location, offering lifestyle, comfort, and views all in one.",
